{"planet":"WASP-39 b","host":"WASP-39","tic":181949561,"detections":[{"species":"CO2","instrument":"JWST NIRSpec PRISM (3.0-5.5 um, ERS)","reference":{"title":"Identification of carbon dioxide in an exoplanet atmosphere","authors":"JWST Transiting Exoplanet Community Early Release Science Team et al.","year":2023,"journal":"Nature 614, 649","doi":"10.1038/s41586-022-05269-w","ads":"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2023Natur.614..649J/abstract","abstract_source":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2208.11692","doi_url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05269-w"},"status":"detected","abstract_quote":"Here we present the detection of CO2 in the atmosphere of the gas giant exoplanet WASP-39b from transmission spectroscopy observations obtained with JWST as part of the Early Release Science Program (ERS). The data used in this study span 3.0 to 5.5 μm in wavelength and show a prominent CO2 absorption feature at 4.3 μm (26σ significance).","curated":true},{"species":"Na","instrument":"JWST NIRSpec PRISM","reference":{"title":"Early Release Science of the exoplanet WASP-39b with JWST NIRSpec PRISM","authors":"Rustamkulov et al.","year":2023,"journal":"Nature 614, 659","doi":"10.1038/s41586-022-05677-y","ads":"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2023Natur.614..659R/abstract","abstract_source":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.10487","doi_url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05677-y"},"status":"detected","abstract_quote":"We robustly detect multiple chemical species at high significance, including Na (19σ), H2O (33σ), CO2 (28σ), and CO (7σ).","curated":true},{"species":"H2O","instrument":"JWST NIRSpec PRISM","reference":{"title":"Early Release Science of the exoplanet WASP-39b with JWST NIRSpec PRISM","authors":"Rustamkulov et al.","year":2023,"journal":"Nature 614, 659","doi":"10.1038/s41586-022-05677-y","ads":"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2023Natur.614..659R/abstract","abstract_source":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.10487","doi_url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05677-y"},"status":"detected","abstract_quote":"We robustly detect multiple chemical species at high significance, including Na (19σ), H2O (33σ), CO2 (28σ), and CO (7σ).","curated":true},{"species":"CO2","instrument":"JWST NIRSpec PRISM","reference":{"title":"Early Release Science of the exoplanet WASP-39b with JWST NIRSpec PRISM","authors":"Rustamkulov et al.","year":2023,"journal":"Nature 614, 659","doi":"10.1038/s41586-022-05677-y","ads":"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2023Natur.614..659R/abstract","abstract_source":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.10487","doi_url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05677-y"},"status":"detected","abstract_quote":"We robustly detect multiple chemical species at high significance, including Na (19σ), H2O (33σ), CO2 (28σ), and CO (7σ).","curated":true},{"species":"CO","instrument":"JWST NIRSpec PRISM","reference":{"title":"Early Release Science of the exoplanet WASP-39b with JWST NIRSpec PRISM","authors":"Rustamkulov et al.","year":2023,"journal":"Nature 614, 659","doi":"10.1038/s41586-022-05677-y","ads":"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2023Natur.614..659R/abstract","abstract_source":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.10487","doi_url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05677-y"},"status":"detected","abstract_quote":"We robustly detect multiple chemical species at high significance, including Na (19σ), H2O (33σ), CO2 (28σ), and CO (7σ).","curated":true},{"species":"SO2","instrument":"JWST NIRSpec PRISM","reference":{"title":"Early Release Science of the exoplanet WASP-39b with JWST NIRSpec PRISM","authors":"Rustamkulov et al.","year":2023,"journal":"Nature 614, 659","doi":"10.1038/s41586-022-05677-y","ads":"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2023Natur.614..659R/abstract","abstract_source":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.10487","doi_url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05677-y"},"status":"tentative","note":"Tentative in this paper (2.7 sigma, 'best explained by'). Later confirmed at higher significance with G395H by Alderson et al. 2023 (4.8 sigma) and int